---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Atribusi & Hak Cipta — Singgah"
  description="Daftar lengkap fotografer, penyedia data cuaca, dan lisensi terbuka yang digunakan di Singgah.">
  <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-20 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-content mx-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-mint text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-3">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-mint"></span>
        <span>HAK CIPTA & APRESIASI</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.5rem,5.5vw,4.8rem)] text-white leading-tight mb-4">
        Atribusi & sumber daya
      </h1>
      <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-text-2 leading-relaxed mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-white/10">
        Singgah dibangun dengan prinsip kejujuran data dan penghargaan penuh terhadap karya kreatif fotografer serta penyedia data terbuka dunia.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-12 font-sans text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
        <section class="bg-[#081822] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-3">1. Data Cuaca & Iklim</h2>
          <p class="text-text-2 leading-relaxed">
            Data iklim historis dan prakiraan cuaca disediakan oleh <a
              href="https://open-meteo.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Open-Meteo</a
            > di bawah lisensi <a
              href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-mint underline hover:text-white"
              >Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-[#081822] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-3">2. Foto & Fotografer</h2>
          <p class="text-text-2 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Seluruh foto yang digunakan merupakan karya fotografer asli yang dipublikasikan melalui <a
              href="https://unsplash.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Unsplash</a
            > di bawah lisensi resmi Unsplash:
          </p>

          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/8 divide-y divide-white/8 text-xs font-sans">
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Rizknash</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Labuan Bajo, Nusa Tenggara Timur</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@rizknash"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Fikri Rasyid</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Bromo, Jawa Timur</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@fikrirasyid"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Afif Ramdhasuma</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Banda Neira, Maluku Tengah</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@afiframdhasuma"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Mufid Majnun</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Yogyakarta, DI Yogyakarta</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@mufidpwt"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Agung Pandji</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Danau Toba, Sumatera Utara</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@agungpandji"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block font-semibold">Ahmad Syahrir</strong>
                <span class="text-text-3">Tana Toraja, Sulawesi Selatan</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="https://unsplash.com/@ahmadsyahrir"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-mint underline hover:text-white">Profil Unsplash</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-[#081822] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-3">3. Tipografi</h2>
          <p class="text-text-2 leading-relaxed">
            Tipografi judul menggunakan <strong class="text-white">Playfair Display</strong> & <strong class="text-white">Instrument Serif</strong> dan tipografi teks menggunakan <strong class="text-white">Plus Jakarta Sans</strong>, berlisensi SIL Open Font License.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
